cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If hairline helped you make the figures in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "hairline: Clean, Predictable Figures for Medical and Data Science"
abstract: >-
  A design system for scientific figures as a pair of matching Python and R packages: one frame for titles,
  legends, panels and captions, one type scale, colour-vision checked palettes, study endpoints that return
  figures, tables and text, and print-ready export.
